# 11. Order Flow

```txt
Customer scan QR
→ open menu
→ select items + options
→ enter pickup_name (optional)
→ submit order
→ API validate product availability
→ API create order (DB function sinh order_code)
→ dashboard receive realtime INSERT event
→ owner sees order với pickup_name + items
→ owner update status: making
→ owner calls pickup_name (hoặc order_code)
→ owner update status: done
```

